Package: clamui-privileged-helper
Version: VERSION
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, pkexec | policykit-1
Replaces: clamui (<= VERSION)
Maintainer: ClamUI Contributors <clamui@rooki.xyz>
Homepage: https://github.com/linx-systems/clamui
Description: Root-owned pkexec helper and polkit policy for ClamUI
 Root-owned wrapper (/usr/bin/clamui-apply-preferences) and the two
 self-contained Python helper modules under /usr/lib/clamui, plus the
 polkit policy, that let ClamUI apply system ClamAV configuration via
 pkexec.
 .
 This package coexists with clamui: it owns only the privileged helper,
 its library directory, and the polkit policy. clamui depends on this
 exact version.
 .
 Replaces clamui so dpkg can transfer ownership of these paths from an
 older clamui (of at most the same version) during upgrade; it declares
 no Conflicts or Breaks and remains co-installable with the full clamui
 package.
